s place:** \\(0 + 0 + 1 = 1\\)\n\n3. **Combine the results:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\begin{array}{r}\n     \\,\\,\\,547,\\!410,\\!910 \\\\\n   +\\,\\,712,\\!680,\\!990 \\\\\n   \\hline\n     1,\\!260,\\!091,\\!900 \\\\\n   \\end{array}\n   \\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1,\\!260,\\!091,\\!900}\n\\]. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
