5** and carry over **1**.\n   \n   - **Ten millions place:** \\(4 + 9 + 1 = 14\\)  \n     Write down **14**.\n\n3. **Combine all the results:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\begin{array}{r}\n     \\phantom{0}7,\\!485,\\!212,\\!99 \\\\\n   +\\,9,\\!370,\\!245,\\!29 \\\\\n   \\hline\n   16,\\!855,\\!458,\\!28 \\\\\n   \\end{array}\n   \\]\n\n4. **Final Answer:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\boxed{16,\\!855,\\!458,\\!28}\n   \\]. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
