.\n   \n   - **Billions place:** \\(1\\) (since there's a carry over from the previous step).\n\n3. **Combine all the results:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\begin{array}{r}\n     \\,\\,\\,956,\\!206,\\!294 \\\\\n   + \\,\\,534,\\!101,\\!039 \\\\\n   \\hline\n     1,\\!490,\\!307,\\!333 \\\\\n   \\end{array}\n   \\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1,\\!490,\\!307,\\!333}\n\\]. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
