\n\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{r}\n\\phantom{0}874,\\!473,\\!157 \\\\\n+\\,775,\\!664,\\!967 \\\\\n\\hline\n1,\\!650,\\!138,\\!124 \\\\\n\\end{array}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1,\\!650,\\!138,\\!124}\n\\]. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
