ed over) \\(= 1\\)\n\n3. **Combine the results:**\n\n   \\[\n   \\begin{array}{r}\n     \\,\\,\\,878,\\!962,\\!317 \\\\\n   + \\,\\,143,\\!379,\\!661 \\\\\n   \\hline\n     \\,\\,1,\\!022,\\!342,\\!978 \\\\\n   \\end{array}\n   \\]\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{1,\\!022,\\!342,\\!978}\n\\]. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
